{"id": "t117-012", "text": "so i caught up with florin after work and um he's finally found a place in bristol it's a two bed near the harbour he moves in on the 1st of december and he wants help with the van that weekend his girlfriend elif is staying in london till february 2027 because of her course and she's struggling a bit with the long distance thing anyway i said i'd do the saturday so remind me to text elif next week and see how she's holding up", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "florin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "found a place in bristol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "two bed near the harbour", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st of december", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "elif", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying in london", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "till february 2027"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "course", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling a bit", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text elif", "owner": "p2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "elif", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t117-015", "text": "nasser said his parents are renewing their vows in june 2027 for their fortieth and he's organising the whole thing he sounds so stressed about it like his sister zainab was supposed to help but she's just had the baby so it's all on him and his mum keeps changing the venue i should give him a ring next week and see how he's coping", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "renewing their vows", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in june 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fortieth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "zainab", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "give him a ring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
